## API Reference

### StreamingResponse

| Prop | Type | Default | Required | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `children` | `ReactNode` | — | Yes | Rendered response content. Pass plain text or the output of a Markdown renderer. |
| `status` | `"error" \| "complete" \| "streaming"` | `streaming` | No | — |
| `copyText` | `string` | — | No | Plain-text value copied by the built-in copy action. |
| `onCopy` | `(() => void \| Promise<void>)` | — | No | Overrides the built-in clipboard action. |
| `onRetry` | `(() => void)` | — | No | — |
| `sources` | `CitationItem[]` | `[]` | No | Optional sources shown as a compact footer disclosure after streaming. |
| `sourcesOpen` | `boolean` | — | No | — |
| `defaultSourcesOpen` | `boolean` | `false` | No | — |
| `onSourcesOpenChange` | `((open: boolean) => void)` | — | No | — |
| `sourceIdPrefix` | `string` | — | No | — |
| `feedback` | `StreamingResponseFeedback` | — | No | — |
| `defaultFeedback` | `StreamingResponseFeedback` | `null` | No | — |
| `onFeedbackChange` | `((feedback: StreamingResponseFeedback) => void)` | — | No | — |
| `announce` | `boolean` | `true` | No | Set false when a surrounding conversation log announces streamed text. |
| `showActions` | `boolean` | `true` | No | Hides the built-in completion actions without changing response status. |
| `className` | `string` | — | No | — |
| `contentClassName` | `string` | — | No | — |
| `actionsClassName` | `string` | — | No | — |

